<title>FRANCE: Cie Bancaire sees good third quarter.</title>
<headline>Cie Bancaire sees good third quarter.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cie Bancaire, part of the Paribas group, expects a good third quarter, chairman Bernard Muller said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The third quarter should be good. July was very good. August and September were good,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>He was speaking after the group announced a drop in first half net attributable profit of 325 million francs but noted that the 1995 figure contained an extraordinary gain of332 million francs o the sale of UCB Home Loans.</p>
</text>
